+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id as the password hashing algorithm, chosen for its memory-hard and time-hard design, which gives improved resistance to GPU-based offline cracking attacks. No parameter values (memory cost, iterations, parallelism) are recorded, so none are specified here.
